  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS-SIDS - IRISH AID GRANT 6/24 V094 WELLINGTON</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide sustainable and equitable access to clean drinking water through the following main activities: Construction of solar water farm supplying 3 litres of drinking water pppd for 519 residents; Construction of drinking water reticulated system to improve community livelihoods; conduct workshops on community vulnerability risk reduction and develop a community Water Conservation Management Plan. This will support an increase in adaptive capacity of the community at IH College and its surrounds.</narrative>
  </description>
